@paymentBaseUrl = http://localhost:5111
@internalApiKey = {{paymentSimulatorInternalApiKey}}
@bookingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Retrieve persisted result-outbox metadata for a booking
GET {{paymentBaseUrl}}/api/payments/by-booking/{{bookingId}}/result-outbox
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalApiKey}}

### Invalid empty booking IDs are rejected
GET {{paymentBaseUrl}}/api/payments/by-booking/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/result-outbox
X-Internal-Api-Key: {{internalApiKey}}
